{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1279,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd2b8a920b4a95d98e5064c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多伯虽然看起来态度很冷淡，\r\n但她只是比较不擅长表达而已。\r\n其实她有很多可爱的地方呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "776efb52c768fc91ab0dea07ff89a81d6f007f9b6166da2561a8793784146592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50c8824cf0c7419327cc7001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动项目里我最喜欢的是棒球。\r\n以前常常约麦昆和多伯一起看球赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1825dd867b340c99cf748a1c0ab0f6c812b7c5d3f3f82353d6d70b96df9cb317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23f47f0ff15c7700787004c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有觉得奇怪的地方，\r\n不要客气，请直接跟我说哦……！\r\n毕竟我不习惯穿这样的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f85709f760473b83c1e88b34c3e79b1194783a0c99c4a1a97e0c1cf7a704139",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95538140e12cd6ce72053adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题、没问题……！\r\n里面是短裤嘛，\r\n就当作跟平常一样就好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ef5a5608caab28cbb31f40b9c888168e021d3144aecab953ee022c178da0af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99dd30186224b49f29778f7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是只属于我的决胜服……！\r\n为了不辜负大家对我的期望，\r\n我要更加努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c439b3cd93a45ef99a781ce6af23fe234175f9bd00f499428ff17a83f6924e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f230729cc6352d2e1d7ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为很好活动，\r\n感觉可以立刻来打一场棒球！\r\n目标是夺三振哦～开玩笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a858575829963bf348efa227fc9e0be50c3d4090a578596cdf843d09d767fdc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb33ecd9ac19f1782527a58a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的制服很可爱吧……\r\n虽然每天早上都穿着出门，但我还是\r\n不确定是否适合自己……啊、啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "227725f0082b5b43e94cc635152067ce1d2d662214f1b0bf343779fc43362c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a78476b133fa8bf16313128a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗帽吃那么多，\r\n她是不是都在做很激烈的训练啊？\r\n我也要向她看齐才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d1b08eee2897432ba2b20030fb912ff913c7f7f921672ac551afbb8f8965fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6922be70f5702ae057a49261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个漫画接下来会有\r\n什么样令人期待的进展啊……！？\r\n唔唔～我要回去继续看了～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb0acc3bc471fcf5c8104f890a318141675fb21a0eb8e137c61ba28dd26ac5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34845450291f21137b9bd1fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「开学当天叼着胡萝卜\r\n撞上命中注定的人！」什么的……\r\n现实中从来没看过呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db8dce1fe93f625f9243618b8e3ecccb76974f67a128f95dd637a002ba1ccdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3250793c6f892dae0a557482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天可能会下雨。\r\n状况不好的赛道我也很喜欢哦。\r\n跑起来的感觉特别强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4eb8a7ac043b455c48ebd34e00eaf65a69534d9737a8065e14cf02ebc4f03f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6ad39172c4037f6b31984c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的水果营养成份很高，\r\n所以很适合用来补充能量。\r\n有种营养在肌肉间流窜的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6b45caa6ce219c217c880771d484866a2daf6c24dad434cad8ccaa71368241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e16e9a5a044f87cab1e8e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「很冷吧？……把手给我。」\r\n唔～！这个台词真的很帅耶～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a6fecf073344fa32d4a2083a66af8afe8277669b175f5391003edc1321f8d09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace8d39dfc28b0dd4cf060d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我跟小涡玩鬼抓人，\r\n她从头到尾都火力全开地抓人，\r\n被追的我也觉得超惊险刺激的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ce25ca0225d707697a2a399d0ae750d3909284ca1b8f9694b3867a2a7c0552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3efac2125630dbbe978d09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小美的口头禅「Marvelous☆」\r\n好像满适合用来当作\r\n健美的喊声呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56929cfe864de8bf52302f0ac3daf36f57620fe0acf876f867e6805f7e3b7284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4704f21dd7faebb22da58ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想象看看阿尔丹这样的女孩，\r\n坐在树叶间阳光洒落的咖啡厅……\r\n根本就是女主角……真令人向往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c567b7d4b64597d1ffaf486088fec25b6dec837ac3abfbd92b699983a28c4b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a024d133f6b01c8dc725181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟小曙一起重训，她竟然误把杠铃\r\n当成哑铃，用单手就举起来了……\r\n我可不能输给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f95d3c48dccc9448f05fca40969f79bdcb7342a4617284b8d95d382032c6533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4acabb66b1c918592b7c45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次我在镜子前摆姿势确认肌肉时，\r\n小微都会以为是在摆变身动作，\r\n跑到我旁边来。真可爱～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1b742c2d3a51ca7bdd845d56ebe4dd7dfa7ac5e80bcbc14ab165d10d2189a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5d56f8e0eb98b3ee07c140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟光明一起去慢跑，\r\n却变得像在悠闲地散步一样……\r\n不过我们还是有跑完全程喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8345d20c667ff74facb54576ba0548c09e98a61f3321d6c460018f00e60a5109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad02fa3c9a5aba9f0edbdae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么既适合这套服装，\r\n又可以吃得优雅的料理呢……？\r\n鸡胸肉三明治或许不错？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08438c28a2cfbf254a3d4fce74e96e217c1eee84ccbab92cfe44f62619c683a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425ac4bbccb0b595467b393d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要想更接近像训练员那样\r\n干练大人的形象的话……\r\n应该先从每天晚上去健身房开始？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2640cd1cb75c490dea04f9e26826e702e7464b843364c5426ad17bfa8050652f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46362488e48611539537a7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我跟善信去了高尔夫练习场。\r\n朝着春季的蓝天全力挥杆……\r\n真是太舒畅了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4327f65fbd8af9b52b45089c777c212d737535cdd85f49ebd771126c224a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19573f1ffa84105bdcb9660",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管再热都不会表现出来，\r\n仍然爽朗地迎接客人……\r\n这正是一流店长的证明吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a952b5378f7e2a62bfeb89d80ecb877f86ebf377029a615649fb64ec32680a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fbd72959ae422396fa0c7ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想配合新衣服顺便改变一下发型，\r\n所以用修图软件把头发修成长发……\r\n但对我来说似乎还是有点太早了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d332c98f39947cfe80b8815dbb2513f28a17b67f11a9d8c310877f63e3937523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed161ce1781bb848d3134c5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "边眺望着窗外的雪，边为\r\n躲进店里取暖的情侣端上咖啡……\r\n这种情景也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8027a0919506a697351ad3d878afb72324703e6a1db15e3b18c871508934e33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1ab72e30a23afce44df492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便在比赛上，我也想要\r\n为观众带来能够激励人心的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc28ec2dca627999e28e3db582b2fcb59b43a5b7c612a1d415a5b24cf66a8d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c310c9656098bb7b49d8d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身衣服，\r\n光是走起路来就觉得自己好潇洒。\r\n感觉有点像真的变身了一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6256c8a3dee347b2e900915e2a7eafe3a48fc1e4bf04b28d873e0273b4257582",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b45f279bd646f893299851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来的自己取决于平时的努力！\r\n今天也要好好锻炼哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48ea71b7c714712fb26e9186150486ca595437959a999760305c32dc3d3e87e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2b324cdd746a4025ecf1567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a28870554c83424f396c8622ca63c1145245bdce94bc6d075587971b9541db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3597eb549a907ac0b9baae9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！背阔肌跟\r\n肱三头肌都感觉不错哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7231fc3a2597d64bf29abb01751027988fea705d13f1d12e375cf2a96d2e6eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e5c8755a0d04ddee61982b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步最需要的东西是什么……\r\n答案就是「肌肉」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba07a2966f31f9dc2a9153561d96bbfa91d363d9406d7756fa33850e0bf9d9db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a41dc77b75a1772d7f7cbc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们开始训练吧。\r\n不赶快活动活动的话，\r\n肌肉是会退化的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b01409d84cf6092ccde4301e1ff3e9287732624f55f583cc54cfc40cde8c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208d83d9d35b37259b428cba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉是不会背叛自己的！\r\n只要持续地进行训练，\r\n我相信它一定会变得更强健！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47e159f713199e9534b506e4f119018d21d637f79ab80f785bad04e839782bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e00c44002030f380035f399",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会想要比任何人都强，\r\n是因为我想要赢……\r\n这份心情，我不会再忘记了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62f01c8107ebd204dd8cbd4edbed39b27ae4a42a4cd13db4077720e890e4dd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fddc0e87708f73177f3d452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要让大家都看到，\r\n因为有训练员的帮忙，\r\n让我「成为了最强的赛马娘」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9799ac2d071791cfbee8a1c85324ce616aa5e65f84cf18a93ad977f615948d23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d88634d7080876a55f11a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就一定能成功！\r\n没错，只要肯努力，\r\n谁都能练出倒三角形的身材！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2c3a59f902fe2cff372337dd10af84831c3dc577c6eb157327ae881d9b2f8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bf4c386423aaa68587deb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是翻转巨大的轮胎，\r\n就是种有效的训练。学园里的\r\n特大轮胎……我翻得动吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6e1e28826d7ff331a19e3c3ae3f69fb7b27eb5f8a2c7854a9688c6a31ed0ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435bd46678c58aecb3bb82f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……就潇洒而优雅，\r\n并且充满活力地开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b42c33fc39d906a0e902f29c6332cb589b6d9586466981e32ccd025338fc94d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85df422726d60610c73c79f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天你也会用最棒的\r\n训练内容款待我吧？\r\n随、随口说说的啦……耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3916838d910818a39a8718ba8cb43cc0aa58745fe62c347e3caab23a522ace94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa53346af4b8e11f94f0aca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我想再把自己逼得更紧一点！\r\n别担心！我带了自己亲手做的\r\n巧克力棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ead3cec76ebbfe49da4a64234d3382b881f0029a0a9b37b275fe82ea0418dda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89340102d76cb45bf6b6fb28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想跑出好表现，\r\n希望能藉此为训练员带来勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff1c866197a491b6600bb96ec055450cc8a583c08c92d575ff270fc58c8577c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3183fc49c397a08985a57b02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要好好完成训练项目，\r\n然后用最棒的胜利来\r\n「款待」训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d371a2d36d6ede8f3c571d848afd022593d2d98c07323ebf3b989e7750dd685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cb0c176627ba3e2a9a0b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……\r\n总是会帮助我鼓起勇气，\r\n对我来说是非常重要的人之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c295f62203bacde628e06e468dd80f6c377b4f9de1c3432a147fd663be885543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506bd8b8b489ec004db89fe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得和训练员一起，就一定能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ee5b2ce86dc8531d3409e2e6e4d39e1bf06146f22982d995ea4dfea0dd08c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e430cfcdee7fc7ca76c2a933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会白费我们一起努力的结晶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "641c1253459f1c45085c6cc6b590504653bbbb783d20ce3389f55410ef031867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8fae2cfeef25c6e4c88229e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否带给了你\r\n足以实现梦想的勇气呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a2891058d1db8c883350d88c0f6505e434a576ab6e2bbf7c758e1bb45f8bd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119564936d1bf3cf10995e88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我的表现还满意吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d335fee55b7f44b504582f4ff9cfa04bcc2539efda5991fc157d9f962fb7a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92534f422838522078389c59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！肌肉正在嘶吼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3dd85f7e939dc729c18ec57ac11cd4a898ad181a00f71c5d2cc3097d29c319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dcc34aefb144cd2403ffa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肌肉的成长没有极限！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30dc042c52191e22ae6d2a39b4c0471f2185132d13ef51ef246565b4d9fad91c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6f1e853c246e368a02a726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是目白赖恩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9589c4157b71a743f94adb9cffe35e2dd30342c8fa76fa55071773a8278802a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64300ca3bc222844948d6c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能帮上更多忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82497f3a114c4ea74dc41756535fa9183450a276c2b3e052d7c32e81fbb0237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff50cbaaf564c475e02d8f46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb361514687f96b7e8ce19c0c8fa4564242ad0839f18d4f68d81df9c59820d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab96b1a4845088a60d1ff7c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不是变得更接近\r\n理想中的大人了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd73c31c7864d20f2f9339599ac062c5560e6a9ec6fb8d448dc1e1a67261312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4966515ea5786a71027c0279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天我一定要成为\r\n精明干练的店长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce06ed5996998fae2f57fcee8622c392442ebe10c9325e7d6f451c7f3513f64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3090e6378771b2c01372f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这杯是能鼓舞心灵的全力之作。\r\n敬请慢慢享用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "316802fbc9a020ce8c78e2236071bdfdde639d45285b75fa60f99764203e9eb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfd26e685b32a20151d9648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临，我是目白赖恩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a325658eb0895c1ff65cc02443ef5048360b8068db289dadc14b69b869de9647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08273066ac094702bd2175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力上吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72bb166c714094d65a64f5d9b155332aa9d4e3fe273dd99590a8df24d54d683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3ea37e2bfb4498939f54c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练跟竞赛以及料理……\r\n全～部都一起加油吧～\r\n目标是做出最棒的「相扑火锅」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "734a614cf7bdcebd09fb35b1e61452628a77791c230081194bee9bc882b3da10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd54861535982b1b1b970d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72dfae705efcef65bc49b38a341c58d191b306f83675cb9c5b9126795dcaea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13bcf5e72bc1c877216b454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23aa53e77ae39f18f608cd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为「真正的相扑火锅」，\r\n有好多东西不可或缺，\r\n不过最重要就是训练员了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e4be80820a036f7700b5aed2e2b3d46c06f49c4ee5bea55989929ebd8ad811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4a72bd8f5a6acc6452ed8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员和大家准备的\r\nbuono的好料，\r\n我永远永远都不会忘记喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7345642feaa40dfe4e853bd9b1ffa8ceee0efba281208ee07559613a50daef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7699577cb982d7dce83444",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～\r\n我会在中央广场捣年糕，\r\n训练员也一起来吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "430a90da55e2a9aaf0a932bacb83b2530113e3a3b3db0879a8178f17427a7690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46c206f90290874c158d7d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了buono的特制巧克力喔～\r\n呵呵，因为我想看见训练员\r\n开心的表情嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79540aafa034d4dffab55bc62a7fc3508f745608b75f4936054d867cdf87080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf6862cb8ade80107802f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我烤了特大巧克力蛋糕～！\r\n因为我想跟训练员分享\r\n自己超级buono的心情～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c56aa3846777dcf2ca7686c64f5b1397d9e77ec8c78be7d6bf01ba957162541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee673b32733f4ffb0f0f9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的愿望啊～\r\n就是希望大家能幸福，\r\n可以做出美味料理☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "170b156fafe6c947ddf4d7abd17731e704420792c12cee28e3b1c0dda3ce4860",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef8ace891363acd69c459f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从甜甜的到成熟口味的点心，\r\n我都准备了很多喔～\r\n没吃完就大家一起开点心派对吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d09d85d3798ddc8d57c4be7d715ab07ddca10ec2b076fcc91bbfb32115d0cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2589a71d46849f40512dbea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火鸡是要大家齐聚一堂\r\n一起吃的餐点～实质上就是火锅☆\r\n我会拿出干劲制作喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9235876b8bb387696291b2dd9ae9c329c4a19a184036bd42e1694a8d29689f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:688adf29d80e2d5d89533114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好开心好开心的圣诞节～☆\r\n我要送训练员一套buono的\r\n幸福全餐当礼物喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd98532d0c44bf347008842a323a981839acf2830c538c2d1993d3323288ab1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:685776b1f918fb52d58b5022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Buono buono！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6cb3cf509ce23bd2e83249b0d6e2fcadca7b86e6aea4d60348e0bbee1bc3aae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3fd0cd7825a65fb4f96ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也辛苦你咯～\r\n在除夕吃些好料，\r\n带着笑容迎接新年吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2810f819638ee9c08399b377030b0e28cc6b285af0b84f302bbdee80c7bcfd45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0727956c6304c20e1add7246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～！\r\n一年一度的大型活动，\r\n得盛大庆祝才行呢～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2e561f038f2e0a5e80a09315995b77881b8fabf33596d32a1efaf3a4edfd6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406034c4f102a4cdd9208cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了个很大的生日蛋糕喔～！\r\n把大家找来，开始训练员的\r\n快乐庆生会吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "692c61f74095cde448c6186239ea065f0d07767abb5c2f9a45e6e59f97d8cc9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fc4ec4fd7d2b495b0939bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凡事都是越大越好喔～☆\r\n所以～我的庆生会，\r\n要招待大～家一起来～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c64716416686e642032cded19f0d999032f5199db1b3358b22603ca3ce392d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e0eb59af371e19cf0581e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物啊～嗯。\r\n应该是希望能让训练员吃到\r\n我的最新料理吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18eeedad55cb658fe0e1d9f82e3419baf3699a3e3a8f6a325dd7951c6a4b092a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86af646b7e4914a87e515d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告耶。\r\n我也很好奇啊～\r\n一起打开看看吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "af3db9a5a4d56973896589cfb19829e19889aa754404aa355a4fc986e4f32598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988dd99563e3773d236a485d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了喔。\r\n里面或许放了很buono的东西～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d6234b7a7117d0b8fa3096ebcee01fce87337ba3ff6b088c6c833e79feb267b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54409c46bfaade72efc30ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务，太好了呢～☆\r\n努力之后的奖赏……\r\n这也是「相扑火锅」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ae7e23fb19f0137bddb37dcb0100a8724b405b623e58de5356dc6a2903bb83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0654daf7280ca01514e20f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动喔。\r\n我来为聚集起来的大家\r\n制作美味料理吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0e3018c856f0154598d7e67ad2828a565e8ddc92b4d846fe8ea714503b011f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e859d5af4b0e5356e7f98cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动气氛很热烈呢～\r\n我们也去吧～！\r\n努力过后吃饭也特别buono喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8dba3f4091ba9d3f7f8c53964572cd1a9e54ae6c4c0606438f41999fc41a358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "10019"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
